---
// Errors as explicit values: wrapping (%w), errors.Is / errors.As, and keeping panic for rare invariants.
const W = 900;
const H = 282;
---
<figure class="gf3a">
  <div class="gf3a-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Diagram comparing Go explicit error value wrapping with %w and errors.Is/As inspection against panic exceptions.">
      {/* Left panel: Error wrapping chain */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="440" height="254" rx="10" class="gf3a-card" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="gf3a-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Errors as Values: Wrap (%w) + Unwrap</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Lỗi là giá trị: Bọc ngữ cảnh (%w) &amp; bóc tách</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="60" width="408" height="48" rx="6" class="gf3a-box" />
      <text x="44" y="80" class="gf3a-b">Root cause: var ErrNotFound = errors.New("not found")</text>
      <text x="44" y="98" class="gf3a-m">Sentinel error returned cleanly from repository / DB layer.</text>

      <rect x="30" y="118" width="408" height="58" rx="6" class="gf3a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="138" class="gf3a-b-ok">Wrap context: fmt.Errorf("read config: %w", err)</text>
      <text x="44" y="157" class="gf3a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Preserves human message AND underlying error chain inside.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Giữ cả thông báo dễ đọc lẫn mắt xích gốc để kiểm tra sau.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="186" width="408" height="66" rx="6" class="gf3a-box is-ok" />
      <text x="44" y="206" class="gf3a-b-ok">Match wrapped chain: errors.Is / errors.As</text>
      <text x="44" y="224" class="gf3a-m">errors.Is(err, ErrNotFound) → true (walks whole chain!)</text>
      <text x="44" y="241" class="gf3a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Use %v to hide internal DB error details at API edges.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng %v khi muốn giấu chi tiết nội bộ ở ranh giới API.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right panel: Explicit checks vs Panic */}
      <rect x="470" y="14" width="416" height="254" rx="10" class="gf3a-card" />
      <text x="486" y="42" class="gf3a-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Why Go avoids try/catch Exceptions</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Vì sao Go chọn "if err != nil" thay try/catch?</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="60" width="384" height="82" rx="6" class="gf3a-box" />
      <text x="500" y="80" class="gf3a-b">Explicit control flow right at call site:</text>
      <text x="500" y="99" class="gf3a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>val, err := loadPort()  |  if err != nil {'{'} return fmt.Errorf(...) {'}'}</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Hàm trả rõ (val, err) — đọc code biết ngay nhánh nào có thể lỗi.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="500" y="118" class="gf3a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>No invisible stack unwinding skipping cleanup between functions!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Không sợ exception nhảy cóc xuyên 10 hàm làm sót logic xử lý.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="486" y="152" width="384" height="100" rx="6" class="gf3a-box is-red" />
      <text x="500" y="172" class="gf3a-b-red">Save panic() strictly for broken invariants / boot errors</text>
      <text x="500" y="192" class="gf3a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>NEVER panic on user input, HTTP 404, or network timeouts.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>TUYỆT ĐỐI không panic vì input user sai hay lỗi mạng.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="500" y="211" class="gf3a-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Unrecovered panic kills the ENTIRE process immediately.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Panic chưa recover sẽ đánh sập cả service ngay lập tức.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="500" y="232" class="gf3a-b">Middleware defers recover() per HTTP request safely.</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Go models failures as normal return values: wrap root causes with %w for caller context while matching reliably with errors.Is/errors.As, reserving panic strictly for unrecoverable bugs.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Go coi lỗi là giá trị trả về bình thường để ép bạn xử lý ngay tại chỗ gọi: bọc thêm ngữ cảnh bằng %w và kiểm tra bằng errors.Is/As thay vì ném exception hay lạm dụng panic.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gf3a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gf3a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gf3a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gf3a text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gf3a-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .gf3a-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gf3a-box.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .gf3a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf3a-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf3a-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf3a-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gf3a-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .gf3a-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .gf3a-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .gf3a-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .gf3a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
